===Etymology===
A Scottish shortening of {{m|en|Allhalloweven}}, from {{m|en|Allhallowmas}} (the obsolete earlier name of [[All Saints' Day]]) + {{m|en|even#Etymology 2|even}} (an archaic or poetic variant of {{m|en|eve}}; see also {{m|en|een#Etymology 3|een}}).

For the American pronunciation with {{IPAchar|/ɑ/}}, compare the Southern English traditional dialect pronunciations {{m|en|fallow}} {{IPAchar|/ˈfɒ.lə/}} and {{m|en|tallow}} {{IPAchar|/ˈtɒ.lə/}}.

