# {{senseid|en|Q251868}} The [[eve]] of [[All Hallows' Day]]; [[October]] 31st; [[celebrate]]d (mostly in English-speaking countries) by [[children]] going [[door-to-door]] in [[costume]] and [[solicit]]ing [[candy]] with [[menace]]s.
#: {{ux|en|They all get dressed up in scary costumes at '''Halloween'''.}}
